          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Sources and ingestion\n",
                "\n",
                "What arrived from each source, and what was held back? Files loaded, duplicates skipped and deliveries rejected, rows loaded per source, the reason for every file not loaded, and the detectors that met a load.\n",
                "\n",
                "Owned by observability. Built from the ops metric views over the compact ops tables (run log, daily telemetry copy, freshness, alerts), joined by run id. Discharges DPC-0057, BATCH-01."
              ]
            },
            "name": "about"
          }
        },
